# Keep the build context lean — only what the image needs (dags/, dbt/) plus the
# Dockerfile. Everything else is excluded.
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.dockerignore
.venv
venv
env
.env
.env.example
Makefile
README.md
ai-plans/
docs/
ebury-docs/
db/
docker-compose.yml
# dbt/airflow runtime artifacts that must never be baked in
**/target/
**/logs/
**/dbt_packages/
**/.user.yml
**/__pycache__/
